    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d90">

                <pb facs="0208" n="92" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg92"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 493.11/512.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Chargé MacMurray to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 299.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-07-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 8, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to the telegram<anchor n="37"
                        xml:id="d90-f1"/> of June 30 by which the Department instructed Mr. C. L. L.
                    Williams, who has for some time been detailed to the Legation as delegate for
                    the settlement of claims arising out of the Revolution of 1911, to proceed at
                    once and take up his post as Consul at Nanking, I have the honor to enclose
                    herewith the despatch, under date of June 25, in which Mr. Williams reported to
                    the Minister the status of the claims with the negotiation of which he has been
                    charged by the Department.* * *</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">J. Y. A. MacMurray</hi></signed>.</closer>


                <xi:include href="d90-a1.xml" xpointer="d90-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
